    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitrap Rehamstered: Brutal Traps, Endless Deaths, and Treasure Beyond Your Wildest Dreams! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Nightmare!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Ohio Jack, a fearless treasure hunter who\u2019s not afraid to die\u2014a lot. <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is a fast-paced, hardcore platformer designed to test your reflexes, patience, and sanity. Perfect for fans of challenging games like <i>Super Meat Boy</i> and <i>I Wanna Be The Guy,\u00a0</i>this game is not for the faint-hearted. Do you have what it takes to survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corpse Bridges:</strong> Death isn\u2019t a setback; it\u2019s a strategy! Dead bodies persist and can be used as platforms, helping you reach new areas or avoid traps on subsequent runs. Sometimes, death is the answer, my friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Editor:</strong> Build your own dungeons, lure unsuspecting adventurers! / Break out of other peoples' dungeons! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30 Story Levels:</strong> Navigate through a labyrinth of relentless traps, spike pits, and hidden surprises. Every step could be your last\u2014so be quick, or be dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls ensure every jump, dodge, and dash is under your command. You\u2019ll need every ounce of skill to conquer these levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and highest scores on each level. Perfect your runs to climb the leaderboards and earn bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> Embrace the madness with a game that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect to die often\u2014and laugh just as much!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Aesthetic, Modern Twist:</strong> Enjoy pixel art that pays homage to classic platformers, with smooth animations and polished visuals in this \u201cRehamstered\u201d edition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are You Ready to Face the Infinitrap?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you crave the thrill of overcoming impossible odds and laugh in the face of danger, <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is your next obsession. Whether you\u2019re a speedrunner aiming for perfection or just a glutton for punishment, your ultimate challenge awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Join Ohio Jack on his deadly quest for treasure\u2014if you dare!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">discord  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Our Discord </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitrap Rehamstered: Brutal Traps, Endless Deaths, and Treasure Beyond Your Wildest Dreams! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Nightmare!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Ohio Jack, a fearless treasure hunter who\u2019s not afraid to die\u2014a lot. <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is a fast-paced, hardcore platformer designed to test your reflexes, patience, and sanity. Perfect for fans of challenging games like <i>Super Meat Boy</i> and <i>I Wanna Be The Guy,\u00a0</i>this game is not for the faint-hearted. Do you have what it takes to survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corpse Bridges:</strong> Death isn\u2019t a setback; it\u2019s a strategy! Dead bodies persist and can be used as platforms, helping you reach new areas or avoid traps on subsequent runs. Sometimes, death is the answer, my friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Editor:</strong> Build your own dungeons, lure unsuspecting adventurers! / Break out of other peoples' dungeons! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30 Story Levels:</strong> Navigate through a labyrinth of relentless traps, spike pits, and hidden surprises. Every step could be your last\u2014so be quick, or be dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls ensure every jump, dodge, and dash is under your command. You\u2019ll need every ounce of skill to conquer these levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and highest scores on each level. Perfect your runs to climb the leaderboards and earn bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> Embrace the madness with a game that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect to die often\u2014and laugh just as much!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Aesthetic, Modern Twist:</strong> Enjoy pixel art that pays homage to classic platformers, with smooth animations and polished visuals in this \u201cRehamstered\u201d edition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are You Ready to Face the Infinitrap?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you crave the thrill of overcoming impossible odds and laugh in the face of danger, <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is your next obsession. Whether you\u2019re a speedrunner aiming for perfection or just a glutton for punishment, your ultimate challenge awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Join Ohio Jack on his deadly quest for treasure\u2014if you dare!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">discord  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Our Discord </p>",
    "short_description": "Infinitrap Rehamstered is a brutal speedrun platformer where every death is a new strategy. Survive 30 trap-filled levels, using your own corpses as platforms. With tight controls, dark humor, and retro visuals, it\u2019s the ultimate test of skill. Can you, Ohio Jack, conquer this nightmare?",
